{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_03f6ee3cb3216d76e21e79fc386b899aab1ca17a9e25b3f6fd38c04e9683e26d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"momozi1996/momo-code@6922581961d5 snapshot 870abd054af90a09","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_076608d91778a026086354c2a976de25d0fc7e15711c84e656193a5df9d61140","slc_dabfca131a11fe2d52c68947d93f6352fb2f8f113d0f6a2c52b7ca516e48a7df"],"source_ids":["src_75fc6f2327e651638ffb3f0d40ef31e4"],"text":"The /agent command decomposes tasks into child momo subagent processes run in parallel with a synthesizer merging results, bounded by env rails MOMO_RLM_MAX_DEPTH (3), MOMO_RLM_BUDGET (8), and MOMO_RLM_TIMEOUT_MS (300000).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f0c61c13a67061253c8049431529122170ac90bd9c359da43e9e28855347741","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"momozi1996/momo-code@6922581961d5 snapshot 870abd054af90a09","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_52613820eafc96f8a54ce8afefe20d75020f109fab1671d905feec0588a8178e","slc_d98e47e726f26c04c1aeaa7b3de5dd399818e28f5b1920765b168e290cbec029"],"source_ids":["src_75fc6f2327e651638ffb3f0d40ef31e4"],"text":"The README describes an experience fast loop (/evolve) using a KEP protocol: observe session signals, distill tactics, select via Thompson sampling, inject into prompts, solidify stats, and promote high-confidence tactics to the fine-tune curriculum.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1d0be991eb85aa51a36239d001c41c71a81a197c4511d1c57bd6eb1dbb22ef8c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"momozi1996/momo-code@6922581961d5 snapshot 870abd054af90a09","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6731fdb04731a7c73a3ce716f9ed9ef119fa8345bbfc61135fd3cab22c50db4c","slc_e930e1747d7bce9a1c7b0997d3d654f27901684d692ab780aa78ec4fbc56ac2b"],"source_ids":["src_75fc6f2327e651638ffb3f0d40ef31e4"],"text":"The product includes task-level evaluation features: `momo /sim eval --tasks=tasks.json` runs batch evaluation with a fresh world per episode, and /optim studies score configurations via a --cmd metric from stdout or --sim Genesis experiments.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0"}
