{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_636ce741eaae905a70798e6da1a77b051d314c48352098915229985fd20889f5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"momozi1996/momo-code@6922581961d5 snapshot 870abd054af90a09","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_482764da702e2e831043f205210ca43c823c4ceb299ca4131200359a0662db3e","slc_8392d706c87dc12592482d475c43b9b596405a794bdd8d32242a033c373a9fad","slc_a8bebf4b71ed1a1c9c103abf22bb1eb3efdfe28a226f554c8ae73e31bb75d01a","slc_caa821a9b178b13cf6afcde21d8cf9c3e6f92171b36d0a0440b6ffa91b2dc779"],"source_ids":["src_75fc6f2327e651638ffb3f0d40ef31e4"],"text":"A `momo serve` command exposes a local HTTP JSON API plus SSE live feed and a single-file dashboard, defaulting to 127.0.0.1:4097; non-loopback binding requires a --token with Bearer auth.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_86e5a6dd80f74dae7c8ca679ff663df4840dc84dcd5efc102fb1c83e226d054c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"momozi1996/momo-code@6922581961d5 snapshot 870abd054af90a09","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_606f85df02e808a967fd12ac7be976a716d6f425619b26ea6aa48f5b39aedbdb","slc_6d54d76730a0a94d475c03f56c3a289238694cdd9d54dc2ca06dd65e8da6429d","slc_e9e9287f761ba82d6bf4118417e0f58e9b12aa6cd3a7e4bb1504b541945dff5a","slc_fd5d9b11b46e90ddd8d810e68694db4537db4d37c6a2e7d3c3f6483df9eb15b0"],"source_ids":["src_75fc6f2327e651638ffb3f0d40ef31e4"],"text":"On first run the tool creates ~/.momo/ containing config (momo.jsonc), sessions, and experience/ with tactics records and a ledger.jsonl audit log; graph state persists to ~/.momo/graphs/<id>.json after each batch so runs survive restarts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","created_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_91557e6776df095f30d2ba63f69d540eabbc4d9ae4ed754f66a2cf179929f204","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"momozi1996/momo-code@6922581961d5 snapshot 870abd054af90a09","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1314a6f90d637c95723e96f72b8ac0297c58d589bc491e8c399758f3e4032d88","slc_5755cffc6c74441fb132a5b7c6362691944817c9df49eb8d1acc62ebd21cd6d9"],"source_ids":["src_75fc6f2327e651638ffb3f0d40ef31e4"],"text":"A weight slow loop (/fine-tune) is documented to improve model weights at hour-level timescales via signal mining, curriculum synthesis, Monte Carlo Graph Search, LoRA fine-tuning, and a ratchet gate for monotonic improvement.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:31Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6cfce975fbc04bc18cf36a381084f0f0"}
